{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wallpaper Live X,\u00a0</strong>brings your desktop to life with beautiful animated wallpapers. From subtle moving backgrounds to vibrant neon designs, find a style that fits your mood. Simple to use and lightweight, it keeps your PC smooth while making your screen more inspiring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wallpaper Live X,\u00a0</strong>also offers videos available from multiple menus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Main Features</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Able to use many videos from software.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The app lets you add background music to enhance your experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The app includes videos from a variety of categories, including space, games, nature, anime, sci-fi, cars, animals, and abstract themes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lightweight and non-intrusive interface</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The app features a modern and intuitive interface for easy navigation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to use</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After launch the app, just click to image.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can surf to another menus</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy it</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4007800?t=1758034761","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007800/1e3f06a925f4769c9073e99168853c31fc781b05/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758034761","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4007800/d6449c41a651e55849d74bff0267b28898c00289/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758034761","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a